lia tells him that she is a dentist  although she never practiced because she  married hanno meanwhile julio and tenoch  tell her that they do not call each  other friends  but charolastras which is almost the  same as friends but the charolais does  have a manifesto of various rules and  statements  it is prohibited sleeping with the  girlfriend of another charlastra and the  truth is cool but unreachable along with  some other along the way a voiceover  which is present throughout the entire  film tells us details of tenoch and  julio's relationship regarding their  social classes such as julio lighting  matches in the bathroom of tenoch's  house and not leaving a bad smell  ortonoch lifts the lid of the bathroom  in julio's house with one foot so he  doesn't have to touch it at night they  go to dinner at an end where julia  confesses that her husband has been  unfaithful many times throughout their  marriage  while they say that they are faithful to  their girlfriends they do not believe  that they're cheating on them now that  they're traveling abroad  later they stay at a motel  she in one room and the two friends in  another the charlastra try to spy on her  from the window but only find her crying  so they leave instantly they resumed the  trip to the beach the next day talking  about ex-partners and sexual experiences  along the way  while we see many landscapes and  emblematic images of mexico such as the  quinceanera some crosses on the side of  the road police officers stopping people  for no reason  cows blocking the road and policemen  stopping humble artisans then their car  breaks down and they are dragged by a  tractor to a nearby town  the tractor driver does not accept any  payment for the favor and also gives  william his hat  they tore a little in this town and lusa  calls honor and leaves him a goodbye  message  later in the motel tenoch finds luisa  crying and she seduces him they do it  although tenoch doesn't last long  and julio can see the