 mother when doing a  spiritual cleansing for him  to notch get serious at first but they  end up laughing still at the same time  lisa puts a song on the jukebox and  starts dancing the three of them are so  drunk they start dancing together  and when they go to the room they have a  threesome and we even see that tenoch  and julio kiss  the next morning luisa talks happy with  the fishermen who invite her to visit  the surrounding bays while julio into  notch after waking up and realizing what  they did the night before they start to  vomit and they say they have to go home  as lisa wants to stay and get to know  the surroundings better she decides not  to go back with the charolastras  during their farewell luisa tells him  that life is like foam and that is why  they have to live like the sea upon  returning from their trip which was very  quiet fulio and tenochti distant  themselves  then their girlfriends broke up with  them when they returned from their trip  abroad  a year later  they meet again by chance on the street  and although they're uncomfortable they  decide to have coffee together julio  tells to nudge everything that has  happened with his other friends tenocht  says that he will study economics and  not something related to writing as he  had planned  and also tells him that luisa died of  cancer shortly after what had happened  on the beach  and he already knew that she was going  to die when she agreed to go on the trip  with them since tenoch had a date with  his girlfriend he has to say goodbye to  julio  julio insists on paying the bill  they will never see each other again  the end if you liked the video please  leave a like and subscribe to continue  receiving recaps of the best mexican  drama movies my name is tc and i'll see  you in the next video goodbye

